###### Corollary 3.3 (Comparative statics of phase boundaries in trust).

The phase boundaries are strictly increasing in β^\hat{\beta} for λ∈(0,1)\lambda\in(0,1): ∂τaug∂β^>0\frac{\partial\tau\_{\mathrm{aug}}}{\partial\hat{\beta}}>0 and ∂τauto∂β^>0\frac{\partial\tau\_{\mathrm{auto}}}{\partial\hat{\beta}}>0.

